From 5ffb4bcd085908973b798226a98219f067a8a2ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:36:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0137: the fight's AI, menus and waits as data
 (MOD_BATTLE grows to 159 slots): the move weights, element bonus, target
 score, 'Your call' rows, command menus by brains, post-fight heal, finisher
 hold and mashing window, and every wait in milliseconds (one slot per
 period); VS combat reads the same table

